te Virtual em realidade aumentada ou modo texto, diretamente durante as li\u00e7\u00f5es em realidade virtual.\n\nEsse assistente est\u00e1 sempre dispon\u00edvel para responder perguntas sobre os conte\u00fados das aulas e tamb\u00e9m sobre os produtos do Grupo Plan Marketing, oferecendo suporte inteligente a qualquer momento do treinamento. Uma tecnologia criada para tornar o aprendizado mais acess\u00edvel, din\u00e2mico e envolvente.", "short_description": "Conhe\u00e7a o Assistente Virtual com IA da VRSchool."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_VRschool.png", "id": "1471508504488603", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604298355_1471508507821936_1033407612722260786_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_oo0Zj9b3UMQ7kNvwGuo56X&_nc_oc=AdogVkfMTcKXDaHt9Vz2mcxiu5GZFpCI6d_E7Ostd0GHP9yGQsUR-XBVGC7iuJ5HP_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9WkzKYWWPAYgI-E0c2ccialRkdj42xxUiadC-ChUme4w&oe=6A466123"}, {"file_name": "logo_VRSCHOOL.png", "id": "1449776713259284", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1449776716592617_1673567406847786742_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jkx_cmDl-QkQ7kNvwFBTG6n&_nc_oc=Ado2sCoB3k05keNe1P7xtxHspjsHPujD2MG19jNj-YTCulgI3-Z7hzqdZteIzJo2szc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8RtaXYreXUFhC9v_PCRl2o9bmfcyCWz5QQTPBaWPVuxQ&oe=6A466929"}, {"file_name": "icone_512x512.png", "id": "1278444900874844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_1278444904208177_5391998273224680991_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rry-AdbRxRUQ7kNvwEfHNVq&_nc_oc=Adp-sTVmlKytKL7CIEtPXsQ0k7HfjwughflQ-cpy-KMaaFVwfVtmLiP-_cVt0KLU2ls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9vfAevXhEMm4-_DA-Aw9PdK79qrUrimA89h6sAOWiyew&oe=6A4671